s6-1-p2 = realized (prose (cons "Let \(\mathsf{Raw}_{\ell}\) be the inductive object syntax at stage \(\ell\), and let \(\mathsf{Der}_{\ell}(\Gamma,c,A)\) be its typing-derivation family. Define checked code **once**:" (cons "\[" (cons "\mathsf{Code}_{\ell}(\Gamma,A)" (cons " :=\sum_{c:\mathsf{Raw}_{\ell}}\mathsf{Der}_{\ell}(\Gamma,c,A)." (cons "\]" (cons "For a chosen semantic model of the selected typed calculus, evaluation is" (cons "\[" (cons "\mathsf{eval}_{\ell,\Gamma,A}:" (cons " \mathsf{Code}_{\ell}(\Gamma,A)" (cons " \to\prod_{\rho:\mathsf{Env}_{\ell}(\Gamma)}\llbracket A\rrbracket_{\rho}." (cons "\]" (cons "A reifiable semantic domain \(\mathsf{Val}^{\mathrm{nf}}_{\ell}(\Gamma,A)\) is equipped with weakening, neutral reflection, and normal-form readback. It is a domain of semantic *normalization values*, not the unrestricted type of all functions from host values to host values. Its fundamental equation binds every parameter:" (cons "\[" (cons "\begin{aligned}" (cons "\mathsf{reify}_{\ell,\Gamma,A}&:" (cons "\mathsf{Val}^{\mathrm{nf}}_{\ell}(\Gamma,A)\to\mathsf{Code}_{\ell}(\Gamma,A),\\" (cons "\mathsf{reifySound}_{\ell,\Gamma,A}&:" (cons "\prod_{v:\mathsf{Val}^{\mathrm{nf}}_{\ell}(\Gamma,A)}" (cons "\prod_{\rho:\mathsf{Env}_{\ell}(\Gamma)}" (cons "\mathsf{eval}_{\ell}(\mathsf{reify}_{\ell}(v),\rho)" (cons " =\mathsf{denote}_{\ell}(v,\rho)." (cons "\end{aligned}" (cons "\tag{6.5}" (cons "\]" nil))))))))))))))))))))))))) (cons (cite normalize-nf "normalize-nf") (cons (cite normalize-sound "normalize-sound") nil))
